Cluster_AKAP8_6	NeST	Cluster_AKAP8_6	AMIGO1 JAG1 LRP5 PLEKHA7	4	Developmental and Structural Modulators	Proteins like *JAG1* (a Notch ligand) and *LRP5* (a Wnt co-receptor involved in metabolic tissue homeostasis) suggest developmental regulation of metabolic tissue architecture and function. *AMIGO1* and *PLEKHA7* also influence cellular structure and junctional stability, potentially affecting tissue responsiveness to hormonal and circadian cues. 	0.74	"Proteins like *JAG1* (a Notch ligand) and *LRP5* (a Wnt co-receptor involved in metabolic tissue homeostasis) suggest developmental regulation of metabolic tissue architecture and function. *AMIGO1* and *PLEKHA7* also influence cellular structure and junctional stability, potentially affecting tissue responsiveness to hormonal and circadian cues. 

