Cluster_PAX5_5	NeST	Cluster_PAX5_5	HLA TICAM2 TLR9 ZBP1	4	Additional Contextual Elements	Other associated genes (*ZBP1*, *TICAM2*, *TLR9*) point toward **innate immune sensors and signaling pathways**, suggesting this system may serve as a bridge between **innate and adaptive immunity**. Furthermore, the presence of MHC-related genes such as *HLA-DRB1* and *HLA-DQB1-AS1* supports antigen processing and presentation, a key function at the interface of innate sensing and adaptive activation. 	0.78	"Other associated genes (*ZBP1*, *TICAM2*, *TLR9*) point toward **innate immune sensors and signaling pathways**, suggesting this system may serve as a bridge between **innate and adaptive immunity**. Furthermore, the presence of MHC-related genes such as *HLA-DRB1* and *HLA-DQB1-AS1* supports antigen processing and presentation, a key function at the interface of innate sensing and adaptive activation. [1][2][3]

